lass=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/986732-new-beastiary-stretch-goal?p=986988#post986988\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You may have meant to imply it, but you saying it &quot;only goes to people who pledge for physical books&quot; made me have to check the kickstarter to see if they'd actually done that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry about that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T04:46:11-07:00","id":987191,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Resplendent Fire</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/986732-new-beastiary-stretch-goal?p=986893#post986893\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It probably helps that the bestiary pdf only goes to people who pledge for physical books. That's probably going to encourage some fence sitters into paying for hardcopy.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Dunno who would be encouraged by some shinny bobble to go from backing it at the PDF level to backing it at the book level *Whistles Innocently*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'll be your Huckleberry","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2397-the-dude","name":"The Dude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T05:41:59-07:00","id":987208,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/986732-new-beastiary-stretch-goal?p=986912#post986912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think it will just be Giants, I just think Giants will get a special focus.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm pretty sure it's just the Giants section at the moment until we hit other stretch goals to expand it, just like how the Scion Companion worked.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T21:10:52-07:00","id":988677,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Axelgear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/986732-new-beastiary-stretch-goal?p=986818#post986818\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bestiaries are great, especially when they're more general. Stats for Krulgor, Frost Giant King of Norway, are less useful to me than general stats for a general giant, then a more powerful version, etc.<br /> <br /> I look forward to hearing more.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I think an important thing to keep in mind when presenting unique individuals is that they can serve the dual purpose of providing a guide on the general thing (in this case, Frost Giants) while also showing an example of how these creatures can be unique. Particularly in a game where stats are not necessarily as important (These creatures might just be presented as Antagonists using quicker rules rather than full characters) it might actually be more valuable to present a unique version because it presents both guidance on the general phenomenon and how to take it a step further.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T21:13:32-07:00","id":988678,"title":"","content":"We're pretty rapidly running out of time to announce and reach more Bestiary content, especially without some new Add-Ons for existing backers to buy. I feel like some pie in the sky stretch goals and the ability for folks to buy, say, dice or the Bestiary would really help push, as I imagine the majority of people who would back already have. I can't afford to go physical, but I'd gladly Add-On the Bestiary to my pledge, and I've already seen a few backers moaning that they literally already have everything and want more things to spend on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T22:56:04-07:00","id":988702,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/986732-new-beastiary-stretch-goal?p=988678#post988678\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We're pretty rapidly running out of time to announce and reach more Bestiary content, especially without some new Add-Ons for existing backers to buy. I feel like some pie in the sky stretch goals and the ability for folks to buy, say, dice or the Bestiary would really help push, as I imagine the majority of people who would back already have. I can't afford to go physical, but I'd gladly Add-On the Bestiary to my pledge, and I've already seen a few backers moaning that they literally already have everything and want more things to spend on.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd be a bit surprised if the KS maxed out at this point - the last week usually sees a big uptick as the deadline approaches and people get reminded about the game. Yep, it's been a bit unusual in seeing an uptick earlier (thanks, Geek and Sundry), but the question would be whether that's from the pool of 'final week backers', or whether that's an audience that wouldn't have known about the KS otherwise...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T19:00:15-07:00","id":989132,"title":"","content":"Therianthrope / were creature chapter in Bestiary at $275,000.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-18T09:28:54-07:00","id":989389,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/986732-new-beastiary-stretch-goal?p=988678#post988678\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We're pretty rapidly running out of time to announce and reach more Bestiary content, especially without some new Add-Ons for existing backers to buy. I feel like some pie in the sky stretch goals and the ability for folks to buy, say, dice or the Bestiary would really help push, as I imagine the majority of people who would back already have. I can't afford to go physical, but I'd gladly Add-On the Bestiary to my pledge, and I've already seen a few backers moaning that they literally already have everything and want more things to spend on.</div> </div> </div> </div> The ability to buy dice is at $165,000 stretch goal, so its up next, just $2,664 to go to reach it, so its a safe bet it will be done today at the lastest, which should cause an explosion in donations to the kickstarter so the $175,000 shouldbe easily obtained.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-18T18:01:21-07:00","id":989636,"title":"","content":"If 435 of the backers add one set of dice for $23 each, that last stretch goal will be reached. That's about one in eight backers ordering a set of dice.<br /> <br /> I wonder if they'll reach it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/610-cjc","name":"CJC","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar610_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-18T18:23:56-07:00","id":989647,"title":"","content":"I ordered 3","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}